# What `release/Dockerfile` leaves out of the build context: build output,
# the SDK's packages a `build.sh` left here, and the P4 fork's six crate
# folders, which `fork.sh` makes again in the build (the script and its
# patch go in).

.git
**/target
release-out*
crates/kassigner-sdk-wasm/pkg
crates/kassigner-sdk-wasm/pkg-watch
crates/kassigner-sdk-ffi/out
firmware/kassigner-hal-esp32p4/esp-hal-fork/esp-*
